# No LFS anywhere in this repo. The only committed binaries are the AUTHORED
# sources -- slicer/parts/*.stl masters and slicer/plates/*.3mf -- plus the
# small generated PNGs the site wants at build time (static/renders,
# static/plate-thumbs). Everything the site serves for download (STLs, plates,
# the all-parts zip) and every product image comes from the content-addressed
# bucket, pinned by URL/hash in the data (see scripts/sync_bucket.py).
#
# LFS is banned by scar tissue: images were briefly LFS-tracked, a CI job
# checked out without lfs, and 130-byte pointer stubs got hashed and published
# under valid-looking content-addressed URLs, breaking every hardware photo on
# the site.
